{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wee Boats is a casual online sailing game where you can relax, explore and most importantly, honk your horn!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578080/extras/wee_boats.png?t=1745528190\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Boat with Friends!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get the gang together and explore with friends! Chat and honk to your hearts content! If you would prefer to sail in the serenity of your own company, you can always play offline. :)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578080/extras/chattin1.gif?t=1745528190\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">See The Sights!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Wee Boats universe has 5 different regions for you to find and explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578080/extras/regions.gif?t=1745528190\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Messages in Bottles!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Drop messages into the online ocean that can be found by future sailors. Leave your mark on the world and see what nuggets of wisdom are ready to be discovered in the waters!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578080/extras/Bottle.gif?t=1745528190\" /></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">All the Boats!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We have a wide selection of micro watercrafts! And remember, the captain doesn't choose the boat. The boat chooses the captain!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578080/extras/Boats.gif?t=1745528190\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Log Your Finds</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Keep track of all the discoveries that you come across in your own Ship's Logbook!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578080/extras/logbook.gif?t=1745528190\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Based On True Boats</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wee Boats is a love letter to the cultural icons of the area around where the game was developed. This is me with the game's star, Beffen, when it was in boat hospital.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578080/extras/jamesbeffen.jpg?t=1745528190\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We hope you enjoy the game! Big Love!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3578080?t=1745528190","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3578080?t=1745528190","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578080/b19e830db42407f71cb1a1e61fb344e9cee0173f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745528190","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578080/b19e830db42407f71cb1a1e61fb344e9cee0173f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745528190","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wee Boats is a casual online sailing game where you can relax, explore and most importantly, honk your horn!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578080/extras/wee_boats.png?t=1745528190\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Boat with Friends!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get the gang together and explore with friends! Chat and honk to your hearts content! If you would prefer to sail in the serenity of your own company, you can always play offline. :)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578080/extras/chattin1.gif?t=1745528190\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">See The Sights!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Wee Boats universe has 5 different regions for you to find and explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578080/extras/regions.gif?t=1745528190\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Messages in Bottles!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Drop messages into the online ocean that can be found by future sailors. Leave your mark on the world and see what nuggets of wisdom are ready to be discovered in the waters!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578080/extras/Bottle.gif?t=1745528190\" /></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">All the Boats!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We have a wide selection of micro watercrafts! And remember, the captain doesn't choose the boat. The boat chooses the captain!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578080/extras/Boats.gif?t=1745528190\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Log Your Finds</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Keep track of all the discoveries that you come across in your own Ship's Logbook!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578080/extras/logbook.gif?t=1745528190\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Based On True Boats</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wee Boats is a love letter to the cultural icons of the area around where the game was developed. This is me with the game's star, Beffen, when it was in boat hospital.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578080/extras/jamesbeffen.jpg?t=1745528190\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We hope you enjoy the game! Big Love!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["James Poole","Laura Ryder","Brendan Hewson"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578080/ef0826504e4d6f2d2bd8e94bdcff133adbd1d666/header.jpg?t=1745528190","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257118115,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257118115/movie480.mp4?t=1745528187","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257118115/movie_max.mp4?t=1745528187"},"name":"Game Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257118115/e09d4599f98dca609f5db6633ee95d77e829edab/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1745528187","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257118115/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1745528187","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257118115/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1745528187"}}],"name":"Wee Boats","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i3 8100<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 400 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i7 8700<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</